      "blue": "Viper two-ship: hot Kutaisi departure, two AGM-88C, two AIM-120C, two AIM-9X, HTS and wing tanks each. Control 251 AM; boom tanker Texaco 253 AM. Destroy the radar first; the Hornet strike pair activates 20 seconds later with two GBU-38 each. Expect a MiG-29 scramble 45 seconds after strike release. A destroyed tracking radar is the gate; this is not an IADS suppression model."
